                                   <div style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222222; line-height: 1.6;"><!-- PAGE HEADER -->
<div style="background-color: #0057B8; padding: 30px 24px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 7px solid #76232F; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.25;">SGSC Diamond Booster Club</h2>

<p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">Supporting Hawks Baseball</p>
</div>
<!-- INTRODUCTION -->

<div style="border: 1px solid #dddddd; border-top: 0; padding: 28px 30px; background-color: #ffffff;">
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; color: #76232F; font-size: 22px;">Thank You for Supporting SGSC Baseball</h3>

<p style="margin: 0;">The coaching staff extends its thanks to all supporters and friends of South Georgia State College Hawks Baseball. Your financial support over the past few years has allowed us to improve our facilities, upgrade equipment, and assist with other expenses for the baseball program.</p>

<p style="margin: 16px 0 0 0;">Whether you are contributing for the first time or have supported the program in the past, your support is important as we continue striving toward our goals of Regional and National Championships.</p>
</div>
<!-- MEMBERSHIP HEADER -->

<div style="margin-top: 35px; background-color: #76232F; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;">
<h3 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 23px;">Membership Levels</h3>
</div>
<!-- HALL OF FAME -->

<div style="border: 1px solid #dddddd; border-top: 0; padding: 24px 26px; background-color: #ffffff;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 30%; vertical-align: top; padding-right: 25px;">
			<h3 style="margin: 0; color: #0057B8; font-size: 22px;">Hall of Fame</h3>

			<p style="margin: 6px 0 0 0; color: #76232F; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;">$500</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: top;">
			<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-weight: 700; color: #76232F;">Includes:</p>

			<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 22px;">
				<li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Window decal</li>
				<li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">4 home game season passes</li>
				<li>2 SGSC hats</li>
			</ul>

			<div style="margin-top: 18px; background-color: #f6f7f9; padding: 12px 15px; border-left: 5px solid #0057B8;"><strong>Hat Sizes:</strong> ____________________ &amp; ____________________</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ALL STAR -->

<div style="border: 1px solid #dddddd; border-top: 0; padding: 24px 26px; background-color: #f7f8fa;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 30%; vertical-align: top; padding-right: 25px;">
			<h3 style="margin: 0; color: #0057B8; font-size: 22px;">All Star</h3>

			<p style="margin: 6px 0 0 0; color: #76232F; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;">$250</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: top;">
			<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-weight: 700; color: #76232F;">Includes:</p>

			<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 22px;">
				<li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Window decal</li>
				<li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">2 home game season passes</li>
				<li>1 SGSC hat</li>
			</ul>

			<div style="margin-top: 18px; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 15px; border-left: 5px solid #76232F;"><strong>Hat Size:</strong> ____________________</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!-- MAJOR LEAGUE -->

<div style="border: 1px solid #dddddd; border-top: 0; padding: 24px 26px; background-color: #ffffff;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="width: 30%; vertical-align: top; padding-right: 25px;">
			<h3 style="margin: 0; color: #0057B8; font-size: 22px;">Major League</h3>

			<p style="margin: 6px 0 0 0; color: #76232F; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;">$100</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: top;">
			<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-weight: 700; color: #76232F;">Includes:</p>

			<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 22px;">
				<li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Window decal</li>
				<li>2 home game season passes</li>
			</ul>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ROOKIE -->

<div style="border: 1px solid #dddddd; border-top: 0; padding: 24px 26px; background-color: #f7f8fa;">&nbsp;</div>
<!-- SUPPORT MESSAGE -->

<div style="margin-top: 32px; background-color: #0057B8; color: #ffffff; padding: 22px 26px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px;">
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 22px;">Be Part of Hawks Baseball</h3>

<p style="margin: 0;">Your Diamond Booster Club membership helps provide resources that support our student-athletes, enhance the baseball program, and strengthen the tradition of SGSC Hawks Baseball.</p>
</div>
<!-- BOTTOM ACCENT -->

<div style="height: 7px; background-color: #0057B8; margin-top: 35px; border-bottom: 4px solid #76232F;">&nbsp;</div>
</div>

